// # emit-x86 string plus paren ALU
//
// Logline: Print n= plus (1 plus 2) so emit-x86 mixes a paren const-int.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Concat n= and (1 plus 2).
//   3. as+ld stdout is n=3.
//
// residual: mix plus unparen ALU stays later.

pub fn main() {
    println("n=" + (1 + 2));
}
